# bp-camp (#125): a hostile dictor (`/bots 1 hostile dictor here`, open mode: the bot grants itself the launcher and probes) in a null-sec system launches a warp disrupt probe on the client within 20 km; the ball renders, a warp inside it is refused, and no second probe goes out while the first lives
fci_bot_camp --with-bots --serial -- --dev
