# s7 (#178): corp shares and dividends: the founding grant, a move with its OnShareChange, a refused over-move and over-draw, a payout by weight and one to members in whole cents with its type-23 notification; two clients
fci_dividend --with-second -- --character Alice --character Bob
# wave 14: a large turret loads the advanced ammo its sheet lists in chargeGroup2 (a T2 800mm gun takes Barrage L, a chargeGroup1 round still loads); fix d2abfed
